{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/152", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"In the style of Telesign documentation, create an easy-to-read introductory paragraph that contextualizes a list of common industry and Telesign terms that will be shared in a public blog post. The target audience of this paragraph should be Telesign customers.\", \"response\": \"As a Telesign customer, you may have noticed that we use a lot of industry and Telesign-specific terms in our documentation and communications. To help you better understand these terms and how they relate to our products and services, we've put together a list of some of the most common ones.\\n\\nThis list includes terms such as \\\"Telesign API,\\\" \\\"Two-Factor Authentication (2FA),\\\" and \\\"Risk-Based Authentication (RBA).\\\" We'll provide definitions and examples of each term to help you better understand their meaning and how they can be used to improve your security and authentication processes.\\n\\nWe hope this list will be a helpful resource as you navigate our products and services. If you have any questions or would like more information on a specific term, please don't hesitate to reach out to our support team.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null